  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento productivo y comercial del proceso artesanal de tejido en lana de las mujeres tejedoras de Cumbal, Nario</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Productive and commercial strengthening of the artisanal wool weaving process of the indigenous women of Cumbal, Nario</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es fortalecer la capacidad productiva y comercial de las mujeres tejedoras de la etnia Pastos, del Resguardo Cumbal, ubicado en el Departamento de Nario, Colombia, para promover su empoderamiento e inclusin socioeconmica. Este objetivo se alcanzar a travs de: (i) la construccin y dotacin de un centro de formacin artesanal; y (ii) el fortalecimiento de las habilidades de las mujeres tejedoras en gestin financiera, innovacin y comercializacin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to strengthen the productive and commercial capacity of the weaving women of the Pastos ethnic group from the Cumbal Reserve, located in the Department of Nario, Colombia, to promote their empowerment and socio-economic inclusion. This goal will be achieved through: (i) the construction and equipping of an artisanal training center; and (ii) the enhancement of the weaving women&apos;s skills in financial management, innovation, and marketing.</narrative>
  </description>
